# Duplicating with DuplicateProductCommand: Invalid Product localized property "name" for language with id "1"

I have an issue with duplicating a product with DuplicateProductCommand in 9.1.4.
<img width="1069" height="771" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23427c57-5188-46e0-8504-d8e5b40bd1dd" />

Code
```
$psProduct = new Product($your_id_product);
$newProductId = $commandBus->handle(
    new DuplicateProductCommand(
        $psProduct->id,
        ShopConstraint::allShops()
    )
);
```

The product name is in Ukrainian: "Персональна електронна обчислювальна машина АРМ фінансової та статистичної звітності". It is 84 characters long, so it does not exceed the VARCHAR(128) limit for this field.

However, stringModifier->cutEnd in the private function getNewProductName of the ProductDuplicator class truncates the name incorrectly, and the resulting array of product names is empty.

Here are the log and the modified code I used for debugging:
